🔨 Ab Kar Kya
Step 1: File Bana
PowerShell mein root folder se:

powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner
code .gitignore
Ya VS Code mein file explorer se → New File → .gitignore (dot zaroor lagana).

Step 2: Content Paste Kar
Upar wala pura content paste kar de aur Ctrl + S (save).

Step 3: Verify Kar
powershell
Get-ChildItem -Force | Where-Object { $_.Name -eq ".gitignore" }
Output mein .gitignore dikhega ✅

Step 4: Git Mein Add Kar
powershell
git add .gitignore
git status
📋 Ye .gitignore Kya Rokta Hai?
Category	Kya Ignore Hoga
Python	venv/, __pycache__/, *.pyc
Environment	.env (but .env.example allowed)
Database	*.db, *.sqlite3
Node	node_modules/, dist/
IDE	.vscode/, .idea/
AI Models	*.zip, *.pkl, *.pt (heavy files)
Logs	*.log, logs/
OS	.DS_Store, Thumbs.db
⚠️ Important
.env.example ignore nahi hoga — kyunki humne !.env.example likha hai (matlab exception). Isliye .env.example GitHub pe jaayega, par actual .env (jisme API key hoti hai) kabhi nahi jaayega. ✅

🎯 Next Step
.gitignore bana ke save kar. Phir bata dena — main .gitkeep command aur push steps de dunga. Ya directly Phase 1 Backend Code start karein? 🚀

Bata bhai kya karna hai.

ait add cmd
🚀 Git Add Command — Pura Workflow
Bhai, .gitignore bana liya? Ab ye commands chala. Step-by-step kar.

⚡ STEP 1: Root Folder Mein Jaa
powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner
⚡ STEP 2: .gitkeep Files Bana (Empty Folders Ke Liye)
Ye zaroori hai — warna empty folders GitHub pe nahi jayenge.

powershell
Get-ChildItem -Path . -Recurse -Directory | Where-Object { 
    $_.FullName -notmatch '\\\.git' -and 
    (Get-ChildItem $_.FullName -Force -File | Measure-Object).Count -eq 0 
} | ForEach-Object { 
    New-Item -Path "$($_.FullName)\.gitkeep" -ItemType File -Force | Out-Null
    Write-Host "Created .gitkeep in $($_.FullName)"
}
Output aisa aayega:

text
Created .gitkeep in C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner\backend\app\models
Created .gitkeep in C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner\backend\app\schemas
Created .gitkeep in C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner\backend\app\routers
... (30+ lines)
⚡ STEP 3: Git Status Check Kar
powershell
git status
Expected output:

text
On branch main
Untracked files:
  (use "git add <file>..." to include in what will be committed)
        .gitignore
        backend/
        database/
        docs/
        frontend/

nothing added to commit but untracked files present
Agar .gitignore, backend/, frontend/ etc. dikh rahe hain → PERFECT! ✅

⚡ STEP 4: Saari Files Add Kar
powershell
git add .
Ye sab kuch add kar dega — .gitignore, backend/, frontend/, database/, docs/, saari .gitkeep files.

⚡ STEP 5: Confirm Kar — Kya Add Hua
powershell
git status
Ab ye dikhega:

text
Changes to be committed:
  (use "git restore --staged <file>..." to unstage)
        new file:   .gitignore
        new file:   backend/app/models/.gitkeep
        new file:   backend/app/schemas/.gitkeep
        new file:   backend/app/routers/.gitkeep
        ... (bahot saari files)
Count check karne ke liye:

powershell
git status --short | Measure-Object -Line
30-50 files dikhni chahiye.

⚡ STEP 6: Commit Kar
powershell
git commit -m "Add complete project structure with gitignore and gitkeep files"
Expected output:

text
[main xxxxxxx] Add complete project structure with gitignore and gitkeep files
 40 files changed, 100 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitignore
 create mode 100644 backend/app/models/.gitkeep
 ...
⚡ STEP 7: GitHub Pe Push Kar
powershell
git push origin main
Expected output:

text
Enumerating objects: 50, done.
Counting objects: 100% (50/50), done.
...
To https://github.com/vishakha2121/ai-autonomous-manufacturing-planner.git
   26cb6e7..xxxxxxx  main -> main
✅ Done!

📋 Pura Sequence Ek Saath (Copy-Paste Ready)
