🚀 Git Add Command — Pura Workflow
Bhai, .gitignore bana liya? Ab ye commands chala. Step-by-step kar.

⚡ STEP 1: Root Folder Mein Jaa
powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner
⚡ STEP 2: .gitkeep Files Bana (Empty Folders Ke Liye)
Ye zaroori hai — warna empty folders GitHub pe nahi jayenge.

powershell
Get-ChildItem -Path . -Recurse -Directory | Where-Object { 
    $_.FullName -notmatch '\\\.git' -and 
    (Get-ChildItem $_.FullName -Force -File | Measure-Object).Count -eq 0 
} | ForEach-Object { 
    New-Item -Path "$($_.FullName)\.gitkeep" -ItemType File -Force | Out-Null
    Write-Host "Created .gitkeep in $($_.FullName)"
}
Output aisa aayega:

text
Created .gitkeep in C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner\backend\app\models
Created .gitkeep in C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner\backend\app\schemas
Created .gitkeep in C:\Users\HP\ai-manufacturing-planner\backend\app\routers
... (30+ lines)
⚡ STEP 3: Git Status Check Kar
powershell
