🎓 Learning Outcomes
This project demonstrates:

Reinforcement Learning applied to real-world scheduling

Discrete-event simulation for digital twins

Full-stack development (FastAPI + React)

Clean architecture (services, routers, models separation)

LLM integration (Gemini) for decision explanation

Modern UI/UX design principles

⚠️ Disclaimer
This is a practice / portfolio project — not intended for production deployment.
The RL model is lightweight (CPU-trainable) and uses a simplified factory model.

